sequenceDiagram
    participant V as ESP32 vase
    participant HM as HiveMQ Cloud
    participant MQ as MqttDeviceCommunicationService (in API)
    participant API as API request pipeline
    participant PG as Postgres
    participant RD as Redis cache
    participant HUB as BouquetHub /hubs/bouquet
    participant BR as Browser on map

    V->>HM: publish vase/{serial}/heartbeat
    V->>HM: publish vase/{serial}/sensors
    HM-->>MQ: deliver (subscribed)
    MQ->>PG: update LastHeartbeat, FreshnessScore
    MQ->>RD: invalidate bouquet:{id} cache

    Note over API: BouquetFreshnessUpdateService tick
    API->>HUB: Clients.Group("radius:geohash").BouquetUpdated
    HUB-->>BR: WebSocket frame
    BR-->>BR: re-render marker
